<!--
============================================================================
  PERSONALIZATION GUIDE
============================================================================
  Everything personal on this site lives in one place: the APP_CONFIG
  object inside the <script> tag below. You don't need to touch anything
  else in the code to change the content. Search for "APP_CONFIG"
  (Ctrl+F) and you'll find everything there:

  1) Names               -> APP_CONFIG.person
  2) Cover photo         -> APP_CONFIG.hero
  3) Photos & gallery    -> APP_CONFIG.photos  (images live in images/)
  4) Memory timeline     -> APP_CONFIG.memories
  5) Small memory cards  -> APP_CONFIG.miniMemories
  6) Secret notes        -> APP_CONFIG.notes
  7) Full letter         -> APP_CONFIG.letter
  8) Interactive question-> APP_CONFIG.question
  9) Final scene         -> APP_CONFIG.finalMessage
  10) Music              -> APP_CONFIG.audio  (put music.mp3 or music.mp4 in assets/)
  11) Colors             -> APP_CONFIG.visual
  12) Love lines/words   -> APP_CONFIG.loveLines / APP_CONFIG.loveWords
                            (shown on every photo instead of a date — this
                             is the "why I love her" text, edit it freely)
  13) Debug mode         -> APP_CONFIG.debug = true/false

  The photos were pulled from the file you uploaded and are sorted
  automatically by date behind the scenes (so the story stays in order),
  but no date is ever shown on screen — every photo instead shows a line
  from APP_CONFIG.loveLines / APP_CONFIG.loveWords. Edit those freely to
  say exactly why you love her.
============================================================================
-->

